    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεύχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join in prayer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
