				1221
			</span></i> (troch.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταὐτὰ δὴ ξ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				646
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς πατρὶ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
